  <a class="link-box" href="https://youtube.com/@panameramedia?si=hf0mOT_ff-5h3fqb" target="_blank"><div><small>MIRA</small>YouTube</div><div>→</div></a>
  <a class="link-box" href="https://www.instagram.com/panameramediaco" target="_blank"><div><small>SIGUE</small>@panameramediaco</div><div>→</div></a>
