    <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-flex;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 22px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:900;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px">BOOKING / SERVICES → Javier@panameramedia.com</a>
